"P1469950025" "Searching..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P288040763" "These bodies have been burned to bone and ash. A few traces of armor are all that show that once these were Warriors"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - BodyClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P3734178117" "Body"
// Description :
"P2286511407" "Find the Book"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1139310123" "You found the book the Warriors stole from the Circle of Thorns"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Body 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3774471435" "This body had been horribly burned. It's only barely recognizable as a member of the Warriors."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P2274296920" "King Thunder"
// Description :
"P3084317118" "Look for Clues"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1827444865" "The things I've seen..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3790327748" "You have disrupted the ritual, found the book, and gained a clue."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2646086110" "From what I can make out of King Thunder's story, it sounds like the Warriors tried to summon something powerful, but it got free. The weird thing is it sounds like whatever they summoned, it went with the Circle of Thorns. Which also matches the ceremony you describe. It seems like whatever crossed over to this world, the Circle was trying to cover its tracks. I don't know what to make of it, but I think this is only the start of something big."
// RandomFameString :
"P947848092" "I hear {HeroName} is onto something big involving the Circle of Thorns."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Lvl6_CoT_Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1072163541" "Though the city's mystics and occultists have been on high alert after you found that Warrior summoning that had gone wrong, the Circle of Thorns have still accomplished a major kidnapping. Their target was a Circle of Thorns mage called Akarist, who had defected from the Circle. Akarist has been in MAGI's protective custody, helping with major mystical cases and working on a complete history of Oranbega. Late last night, Akarist's warded safe house was broken into, his guards incapacitated, and Akarist himself abducted. Akarist's loss is a major blow, and the timing of it seems like more than a coincidence. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Can I trust you to look into Akarist's kidnapping?</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1528804453" "Look into Akarist's Kidnapping"
// SendOffString :
"P3436010432" "I have a clue to where Akarist may be. Your goal will be to go in and find him. It's unlikely the Circle will harm him yet, but if he's not found soon they may remove him from his body and place his soul into a crystal of torment. With all the help he's provided the city, he deserves better than that."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1895768246" "Locate Akarist"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P443900610" "Your objective is to find Akarist, or at least some trace of where he may be."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2924302550" "You follow the paths through caves and tunnels to a part of the lost city of Oranbega."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P4019216084" "My senses are tingling!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P2988533518" "A disturbance!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1228039084" "Guardian of Flame"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2231848377" "I guard this place. None shall evade my watch."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1746228961" "In this place you shall find only Doom."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Books 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P1778979957" "Books"
// Description :
"P2951438432" "Find Akarist"
// InteractBeginString :
"P2204921072" "You begin searching the books"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2822031837" "You finish searching the books"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3495604931" "You found some of Akarist's books."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4026650512" "Though Akarist was not there, you did find several books he had written."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P413750523" "I'm sorry, {HeroName}, it looks like my information wasn't completely correct. Finding his books might be a good step, though. I'll talk with some of the dowsers I know, they may be able to get a better idea of where Akarist is by using these books. Talk to me shortly, there may be another chance to find Akarist soon."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Lvl6_CoT_Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2861971110" "The Circle of Thorns is still holding Akarist, the Circle defector they kidnapped right after they tricked the Warriors into summoning something for them. However, I think I've got a solid location on where they're holding him. If my resources are correct, he's not being held in Oranbega, but in an abandoned office building here in the city. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Can you rescue Akarist before the Circle can extract their revenge on him?</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2456525458" "Rescue Akarist"
// SendOffString :
"P3446700342" "Once again, your main goal is to find and rescue Akarist. I just hope he's still in a human form when you reach him."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2087408285" "Your main goal is to find and rescue Akarist, whether he's still in his body or bound in a Soul Crystal."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1456236980" "Long strips of paint peel off the walls in delicate flakes with every step you take. The moldering carpet and paint flakes reveal a trail of other visitors to this place."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1741441875" "What next for the traitor Akarist?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1880371041" "Imprisonment within a crystal of torment is too good for him."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P846479094" "You shall not rescue the traitor, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Akarist 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P3902314529" "Akarist"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1278562860" "I am somewhat pleased to see that the city truly does seem to care about my fate."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3878626875" "You have rescued Akarist from the Circle of Thorns"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1963002092" "Akarist says that the Warriors summoned a demon, didn't bind it, and now it's free and negotiating with the Circle of Thorns? This is bad, {HeroName}. Really bad. It's not over though. If the Circle felt that it needed Akarist's expertise in dealing with a demon, then they can't be that certain about the deal yet. I'll work with Akarist and every contact I have. With your help, this can be stopped. Talk to me soon for any new developments."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Lvl6_CoT_Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4000075099" "I've had a chance to talk to Akarist about the Demon the Circle of Thorns have summoned. He calls it the Envoy of Shadow, and says that it's an emissary of the Demon Prince the Oranbegans dealt with before. He thinks that the thing will demand a human sacrifice as part of whatever bargain it's making, and probably a large one. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Will you help stop the sacrifice to the Envoy of Shadow?</A><br>Akarist says that there's a chance the Envoy itself may be there to accept the sacrifices, so it would probably be a good idea to gather allies for this mission."
// AcceptString :
"P3408172293" "Disrupt the sacrificial tribute for the Envoy of Shadow"
// SendOffString :
"P147020762" "Akarist has pointed us towards the ceremony will most likely take place, and it coincides with something else. I've just gotten word that 13 police officers haven't shown up for work today, but that one of them got a call out on his radio that she was taken underground by Circle Sorcerers. Your main goal will be to find and rescue all of the kidnapped police and disrupt any sacrificial ceremony. Also, look for any evidence of what sort of deal the Envoy may be here to make. <br>If the Envoy itself is there, Akarist warned that defeating it won't be enough to destroy it, but might give you an idea of how to fight it. Use your own discretion on that."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2887497788" "Stop Circle's sacrifice"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1945112403" "Your main goal will be to find and rescue all of the kidnapped police and disrupt any sacrificial ceremony. Also, look for any evidence of what sort of deal the Envoy may be here to make. <br>If the Envoy itself is there, Akarist warned that defeating it won't be enough to destroy it, but might give you an idea of how to fight it. Use your own discretion on that."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3329532355" "The anguished cries of the City's defenders mix with the ancient Chants of the Circle of Thorns."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P716259625" "Envoy of Shadow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P614794670" "{HeroName}, I shall savor the destruction of your soul!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3623655385" "Know this: I have come here unbound and un-named. Even if you defeat me, I shall return, immortal on this plane."

