"P3712537243" "This has been crazy. Thanks for the save, {Rescuer}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostages4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2855526977" "You're the greatest, {Rescuer}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Altar 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P950630402" "Altar"
// Description :
"P86810688" "clues to find"
// SingularDescription :
"P2960848008" "Look for clues"
// InteractBeginString :
"P3596617137" "You begin searching the Altar"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P4248346780" "You finish searching the Altar"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2974894735" "You found something"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBegin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1937356994" "Akarist also sent this for you. It's something he's written about Demons and the sacrifices they demand. It might provide you with an insight to the Envoy of Shadow and what it's after."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P109688182" "You have rescued the kidnapped officers and disrupted the sacrifice ceremony."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1653202609" "You saved a lot of lives today, and may have disrupted the Envoy's negotiations. According to Akarist, that won't be enough to stop things, but it should slow them down. The Envoy can be defeated, but it can't be destroyed or banished, at least not yet. I'll also ask Akarist about this 'Hequat' you found mentioned. Check with me again soon."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Lvl6_CoT_Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2225871386" "Akarist was nearly overcome with fear when I told him about the message you found when you stopped that sacrifice. The Envoy's message talked about this 'Hequat' returning, and that concept really worried Akarist. He says that it's likely the Circle will try to confirm this on their own. This might match with reports that the Circle of Thorns have taken over a small office and are preparing some kind of ceremony there. The ceremony could have a darker purpose, too, so the best bet would be to break it up, and look for any clues. If they are trying to confirm that Hequat is active, <A HREF={ACCEPT}>then that's something we need to know, too.</A> <br>Akarist says that if they are trying to determine that, the ritual will be well guarded, and you'd do well bring along allies."
// AcceptString :
"P1420341075" "Disrupt the ritual and look for signs that Hequat is returning."
// SendOffString :
"P4071301659" "Your main goal is to disrupt the ceremony itself, and to find any evidence that this Hequat entity is active."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3988701959" "Disrupt ritual & look for clues"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2732571509" "As you enter this office it seems that the world has gone completely silent, save for the soft chanting of Circle ceremonies"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3320737368" "The Inquisitor"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1642404789" "We should have results soon."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2809749342" "This is too important to brook any interference."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - CEREMONY_INCANTING_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// CEREMONY_INCANTING_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3603331213" "Ob sal cuyetethic Hequat desratikka!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - CEREMONY_INCANTING_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// CEREMONY_INCANTING_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1617682543" "What is this!? Crush them!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Altar 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P3553568753" "Clues"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P227635042" "You found a clue"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBegin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P71099257" "Akarist has another message for you. This one's about Hequat, and why the Circle would be afraid of her. It's enough to make me afraid of  the consequences if she really does return."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1082632000" "You have stopped the Ceremony and found a clue to the status of Hequat."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2718652751" "It's good that you hit that ritual, even if the results were inconclusive. Hequat still exists, though, and that may be enough to lean the Circle towards working with the Envoy. If the Circle starts to consider accepting the deal, then we will have to move fast to stop them. Check with me soon, {HeroName}, I'll keep looking into this."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Lvl6_CoT_Mission6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4212364477" "All of your work to stop the Envoy of Shadow and the Circle from making a deal is paying off, but the there has been a repercussion. The Envoy is preparing to accelerate the deal, and is going to make a ceremonial gift of new Thorn Blades to the Circle of Thorns. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I'd like you to disrupt this exchange, and take those Thorn Blades.</A> <br>The Envoy itself is likely to be there, and defeating him will be necessary to break his ability to sense and retrieve the Thorn Blades. It might be a good idea to have allies with you for that reason, if you haven't already gathered some."
// AcceptString :
"P2509709552" "Steal the Envoy's gifts to the Circle of Thorns."
// SendOffString :
"P2386258643" "You'll have three things to do in this. First, you must get the Thorn Blades. Second, you need to defeat the Envoy of Shadow. You won't be able to stop him permanently, but the time it takes him to re-form himself will give us enough time to secure the Thorn Blades so they're invisible to him. Third, Akarist says that it's very likely that the Circle will be trying to find some leverage on the Envoy. So, keep an eye out for what the Circle is up to."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3829387374" "Defeat Envoy & its minions"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P967678281" "These caverns reach deep into the earth, a network of twisted tunnels that are a perfect for a being of darkness to make dread bargains."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1709982457" "Envoy Of Shadow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2113494915" "The Acceptance of the Thorn Blades shall re-affirm old treaties."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P820626093" "Why do you challenge me, {HeroName}? I am immortal and beyond your power!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Chest 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P3327140649" "Thorn Blades to find"
// SingularDescription :
"P959188199" "Find last blade!"
// InteractBeginString :
"P3108683416" "You begin opening the chest"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P152247694" "You have opened the chest"
// InteractActionString :
"P1143515829" "Opening..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2444350714" "You found the Thorn Blades"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Altar 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P3360217240" "Clues to find"
// SingularDescription :
"P480797583" "Seek clues"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4054613952" "You found a clue to the Circle's plans"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBegin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2791143837" "Akarist has another message for you, this one about the Thorn Blades themselves and their importance in a deal with the Demon Prince."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3015880724" "You have taken the Thorn Blades and found some valuable information."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3589477239" "Those Thorn Blades will be well hidden and protected until they can be safely studied. Good work. From the notes you found it looks like the Circle of Thorns are trying to discover the true name of the Envoy of Shadows. Names are very important in magic, and having the fiend's true name could be a big advantage. Talk with me about this soon, there may be a way to use this information."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Lvl6_CoT_Mission7 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3026071486" "After you found out that the Circle was looking for the Envoy of Shadow's true name when you captured the Thorn Blades, I spoke with Akarist. He agrees that finding the true name of the Envoy of Shadow could be the key to destroying the beast before it can complete a deal with the Circle of Thorns. If the Circle can find the Envoy's true name first, however, they will use it to secure a better deal for themselves, and from the outcome of the last time the Circle made deals with demons, I'm not sure I want to see what would happen if they got a good bargain. Akarist has narrowed down where the Circle would likely be working on discovering the Envoy's True Name. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>The hard part will be going in and getting it. Are you ready for that?</A> <br>The Name research will be well guarded. Allies would be very useful to you."
// AcceptString :
"P119648527" "Strike Circle Naming Research and get Envoy's True Name."
// SendOffString :
"P3128107719" "There are two objectives for you to accomplish here. First, you must find what the Circle already knows about the Envoy of Shadow's True Name. Once we have that, Akarist and the MAGI researchers are confidant they can work out the rest. Second, we don't want the Circle to discover the Envoy's True Name, so you need to disrupt any ceremonies or rituals they're performing and defeat the Circle members or minions performing it."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P325727459" "Stop lead researcher & his men"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P4071966234" "You descend once again into the far depths of Oranbega."

