"P4085130498" "You found the Circle's notes on the Envoy of Shadow's True Name."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBegin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1409559740" "Akarist has also sent another message for you. This one is about True Names. It should give you an idea of how important getting the Envoy's True Name could be."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P415981256" "You have disrupted the Circle's research and found their information on the True Name of the Envoy of Shadows."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
